	(footprint "ADF5901_LFCSP32"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "0349c0bf-334d-479d-9262-b0d73a9d7c61")
		(at 51 23 180)
		(descr "ADF5901, 32-lead LFCSP_WQ 5x5mm (CP-32-12), 0.5mm pitch, EP 3.60mm sq (datasheets/extracted/adf5901.md Fig.32 p.26). Land pattern extrapolated per ADI AN-772 LFCSP design guide (no separate ADI recommended-land drawing printed in ADF5901 datasheet): land length = lead length(0.40mm)+0.10mm toe growth = 0.50mm; land width capped at AN-772 Table II X_MAX=0.28mm for 0.5mm pitch (avoids solder bridging vs. max lead width 0.30mm). Verified against ADI AN-772 (Rev.0) 'A Design and Manufacturing Guide for the LFCSP' Table I-III formulas (ZD_MAX=D_MIN+2*J_T+T_T, J_T_min=0.1mm; X_MAX=0.28mm@0.5mm pitch); no ADI CP-32-12-specific land drawing found separate from CP_32_xx family PDFs (connection timed out fetching exact CP-32-12 sheet) so extrapolation retained per Task 3 disclosure. Thermal via grid 3x3 @1.2mm pitch, 0.3mm drill/0.6mm pad (AN-772 recommends 0.30-0.33mm drill, 1.0-1.2mm pitch). EP paste windowed 4-quadrant, 70% coverage.")
