		(descr "ADP7104ARDZ-3.3 (ultralow-noise LDO, per datasheets/extracted/ev-radar-mmic2.md BOM: U6/U7, 3.3V output, feeds AVDD_TX/AVDD_RX MMIC rails). Package: 8-Lead SOIC_N_EP narrow body, ADI designator RD-8-2, JEDEC MS-012-AA (confirmed directly from datasheets/ADP7104.pdf Rev.I Figure 81, 'Outline Dimensions' p.24). Land pattern: body 3.90mm(nom, 3.80-4.00mm) x 4.90mm(nom, 4.80-5.00mm) excluding leads, overall footprint span 6.00mm(nom, 5.80-6.20mm) across leads, 8 leads at 1.27mm BSC pitch, lead width 0.31-0.51mm/length 1.25-1.65mm (land pads sized per standard IPC gullwing land rule: 1.95x0.6mm at 1.27mm pitch, matching KiCad stock SOIC-8-1EP_3.9x4.9mm_P1.27mm land geometry). EP corrected to the ADP7104-specific Fig.81 dimension: 2.41mm x 3.098mm (was erroneously 2.41x3.3mm, copied from a generic KiCad stock RD-8 EP size class instead of this part's own datasheet figure). EPAD is internally bonded to GND per datasheet Table 5 p.6; recommend connecting to board ground plane.")
